{{Top}}
{{Conflicting|''[[Star Wars: Absolutely Everything You Need to Know]]''|''{{BuildFalconCite|61|Guide to the Galaxy}}''}}
{{Quote|For almost three standard years, this war has raged. We can barely even count the numbers of the fallen.|[[Jedi Master]] [[Plo Koon]] laments the [[Clone Wars]]|<ref name="Dark Disciple">''[[Dark Disciple]]''</ref>}}
A '''standard year'''<ref name="Dark Disciple" /> ('''SY'''),<ref name="Star Wars: Scum and Villainy">''[[Star Wars: Scum and Villainy: Case Files on the Galaxy's Most Notorious]]''</ref> also known as a '''standard-year'''<ref name="CL2016">[[Star Wars: Complete Locations (2016)|''Star Wars: Complete Locations'']]</ref> or simply a '''year''' or a '''cycle''',<ref name="Rey's Story">''[[The Force Awakens: Rey's Story]]''</ref> was a measurement of [[time]].

On [[Coruscant]], a year was made up of 365 [[Standard day|days]] of 24 [[Standard hour|hours]] each,<ref name="AEYNK">''[[Star Wars: Absolutely Everything You Need to Know]]''</ref> with no leap years.<ref name="SWCE 2016 DK Books Liveblog">{{SW|url=news/swce-2016-absolutely-everything-you-need-to-know-about-dk-star-wars-books-panel-liveblog|text=SWCE 2016: Absolutely Everything You Need to Know About DK ''Star Wars'' Books Panel Liveblog}}</ref> The galaxy used a standardized dating system based off of the [[The galaxy|galactic]] [[capital]] Coruscant.<ref name="Future of the Force Recon">{{RebelsRecon|sM_ZpTwSwuw|#2.09: Inside "The Future of the Force" &#124; Star Wars Rebels|sw_url=video/disneyxd-rebels-recon-inside-the-future-of-the-force}}</ref> By the time of the [[New Republic]], the [['ABY-BBY' dating system|dating system]] would use the [[Battle of Yavin]] as the epicenter on which to date years.<ref name="GA">''[[Star Wars: Galactic Atlas]]''</ref>

On certain planets, including Lothal, a year was divided into four seasons ([[spring]], [[summer]], [[autumn]], and [[winter]]) characterized by specific meteorological or climatic conditions.<ref name="edge">''[[Servants of the Empire: Edge of the Galaxy]]''</ref> The [[planet]] [[Lothal]] based its yearly calendar on a system known as [[Lothal Calendar|Lothal Years]].<ref name="VG">''[[Star Wars Rebels: The Visual Guide]]''</ref> A being's age was usually expressed in years.<ref name="WaldDB">{{Databank|wald|Wald}}</ref><ref name="EzradDB">{{Databank|ezra-bridger|Ezra Bridger}}</ref><ref name="ArtooDB">{{Databank|r2-d2|R2-D2}}</ref>

The passage of ten years was referred to as a decade,<ref name="Wine in Dreams">{{StoryCite|story=The Wine in Dreams|book=Canto Bight (novella collection)}}</ref> whilst a hundred years was a [[Standard century|century]],<ref name="DV3">[[Darth Vader (2015) 3|''Darth Vader'' (2015) 3]]</ref> and a thousand years being a [[millennium]].<ref name="TPM">{{Film|I}}</ref>

